        {
            "name": "Phone numbers",
            "x-tag-expanded": false,
            "description": "This method group is used for retrieving and updating DID number assigned to your account as well as ordering new ones.\n\nTo order new numbers, you must first select a country - use `GET /dids/new-numbers/countries` endpoint to see a list of available countries and get country resource ID.\n\nThen, you need to get price group resource ID, that is required for creating an order. Use `GET /dids/new-numbers/countries/{id}/price-groups` (where id is country resource id) endpoint to retrieve a list of available numbers for a specific country.\n\nFinally, send a request to `POST /dids/orders` with your desired price group resource ID. For other necessary fields, check `POST /dids/orders` request body."
        }
